.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void csmp::PDE_Integrator_Test::TestMatrix (const \fBPDE_Integrator_Attorney\fP< dim > & attorney, const \fBMeshManager\fP< dim > & mesh, const set< \fBBOX_BOUNDARY\fP > & dirich, const \fBVARIABLE_TYPE\fP variable_type)"
Generic function to test the matrix accumulated in \fBPDE_Integrator\fP from \fBLHS_FixedValueMatrix\fP 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIattorney\fP \fBAttorney\fP to the \fBPDE_Integrator\fP being tested 
.br
\fImesh\fP Mesh of the model used in this test 
.br
\fIdirich\fP \fBBOX_BOUNDARY\fP codes on which Dirichlet conditions are set 
.br
\fIvariable_type\fP Type of \fBTest\fP variable (currently SCALAR or VECTOR only)
.RE
.PP
This function tests that
.IP "1." 4
diagonal terms are positive
.IP "2." 4
off-diagonal terms for nodes belonging to the same \fBElement\fP are negative
.IP "3." 4
all other terms are zero 
.PP

.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void csmp::PDE_Integrator_Test::TestRHSVector (const \fBPDE_Integrator_Attorney\fP< dim > & attorney, const \fBMeshManager\fP< dim > & mesh, const double val, const set< \fBBOX_BOUNDARY\fP > & dirich, const \fBVARIABLE_TYPE\fP variable_type)"
Generic function to test the RHS vector accumulated in \fBPDE_Integrator\fP from \fBRHS_FixedValueMatrix\fP 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIattorney\fP \fBAttorney\fP to the \fBPDE_Integrator\fP being tested 
.br
\fImesh\fP Mesh of the model used in this test 
.br
\fIdirich\fP \fBBOX_BOUNDARY\fP codes on which Dirichlet conditions are set 
.br
\fIvariable_type\fP Type of \fBTest\fP variable (currently SCALAR or VECTOR only)
.RE
.PP
This function tests that RHS value for a given non-Dirichlet node is the value input in the constructor times the number of parent elements for this node\&. 

